            <h3>Departure Airport: Hartsfield-Jackson Atlanta International Airport (ATL) </h3>
            <p>The world's busiest airport by passenger traffic, Hartsfield-Jackson serves as the primary departure point for Southeastern travelers heading to Hawaii. Its massive scale and efficient design handle extraordinary volume with remarkable fluidity. </p>
